### **Zone-Aware HVAC Optimization** (Future Enhancement)

**Status**: 🔮 Future
**Created**: 2026-01-29
**Related**: AI Optimizer multi-device support

**Overview**: Extend the AI optimizer to support zone-aware optimization rules. Currently, all devices of the same type receive the same optimization rules. Zone-aware optimization would allow different rules based on device location (floor, wing, exposure direction).

**Potential Features**:
- Location-based temperature adjustments (e.g., south-facing zones need more cooling)
- Floor-specific rules (higher floors vs ground floor thermal characteristics)
- Occupancy-zone integration (conference rooms vs open office vs server rooms)
- Time-based zone profiles (morning pre-conditioning for specific areas)

**Implementation Considerations**:
- Extend device model with zone metadata (floor, wing, exposure, zone_type)
- Add zone rules to optimization rule engine
- Group devices by zone for coordinated optimization
- Support zone priority levels for load shedding scenarios

**Dependencies**:
- Multi-device optimization support ✅ (implemented 2026-01-29)
- Device location metadata standardization (see NAMING_CONVENTIONS.md)

