## 1. SENTINEL Solar ☀️

### Purpose
Manage and optimize solar PV installations across the portfolio.

### Why It Matters
- Solar is exploding in SA commercial property (load shedding driver)
- Most FM companies manage solar reactively
- Huge optimization opportunity in battery + grid + solar balancing

### Key Features

