│  │                                                                    │    │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │
│                                                                              │
│  → HVAC OPTIMIZATION: Level 3 at 32% - AHU-007 reduced to 45%             │
│  → LIGHTING: Parking P2 dimmed to 40% (motion-activated boost)            │
│                                                                              │
│  EQUIPMENT HEALTH                                                           │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │
│  │  🔴 Door D-L2-017: Motor drawing 2.3A (rated 1.8A) - binding       │    │
│  │  🟡 Camera CAM-P1-003: Offline 2 hours - check connection          │    │
│  │  🟡 Reader R-GF-002: 12% badge read failures - clean/replace       │    │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │
│                                                                              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Predictive Capabilities
- **Access controller failures** - battery backup depletion, communication issues
- **Door hardware degradation** - motor current, cycle counts
- **Camera health** - image quality degradation, storage issues
- **Reader failures** - read success rates, response times

### Integration Value
- **Occupancy → HVAC** - real occupancy data for optimization
- **Occupancy → Lighting** - presence-based control
- **After-hours access → Alerts** - unusual patterns flagged
- **Emergency → FM response** - coordinated building response

