### Key Compliance Areas (SA)
- **Fire safety** - Certificates, inspections, drill records
- **Electrical** - CoC renewals, RCD testing, earth leakage
- **OHS Act** - Risk assessments, incident reporting, training
- **Lifts & escalators** - Registration, inspections, load tests
- **Pressure equipment** - Boiler inspections, pressure vessel certs
- **Environmental** - Waste management, emissions, water discharge
- **Food safety** - Where food courts/kitchens present

### Automation Features
- **Auto-scheduling** - Book inspections before expiry
- **Document management** - Central certificate repository
- **Audit trails** - Complete compliance history
- **Alert escalation** - Overdue items to management

