## 8. SENTINEL Fleet 🚗

### Purpose
Manage FM fleet vehicles and mobile workforce.

### Why It Matters
- Fleet is major cost center
- Routing optimization saves time/fuel
- Vehicle maintenance often reactive

### Key Features
- **GPS tracking** - Real-time vehicle locations
- **Route optimization** - Minimize travel between jobs
- **Fuel management** - Consumption tracking, anomalies
- **Maintenance scheduling** - Service intervals, predictive
- **Driver behavior** - Speed, harsh braking, idling

