## MODULE SUMMARY

| Module | Priority | Complexity | Differentiation | SA-Specific |
|--------|----------|------------|-----------------|-------------|
| Solar ☀️ | HIGH | Medium | High | Very High |
| Water 💧 | HIGH | Medium | Medium | High |
| Security 🔒 | Medium | Medium | Medium | Low |
| Compliance 📋 | HIGH | Low | Medium | High |
| Sustainability 🌱 | HIGH | Medium | High | Medium |
| Tenant 👥 | Medium | Low | Medium | Low |
| Contractor 🔧 | Medium | Low | Medium | Medium |
| Fleet 🚗 | Low | Medium | Low | Low |
| Emergency 🚨 | Medium | High | High | Medium |

---

## RECOMMENDED PRIORITY

### Phase 1 (Core) - Months 1-6
1. SENTINEL Watch (Predictive Maintenance)
2. SENTINEL Guide (AI Assistant)
3. SENTINEL Insights (Client Portal)

### Phase 2 (Optimization) - Months 7-12
4. SENTINEL Optimize (HVAC Control)
5. SENTINEL Solar (PV Management)
6. SENTINEL Energy (expanded from current)

### Phase 3 (Expansion) - Months 13-18
7. SENTINEL Water (Leak Detection)
8. SENTINEL Compliance (Regulatory)
9. SENTINEL Sustainability (ESG)

### Phase 4 (Ecosystem) - Year 2+
10. SENTINEL Tenant (Experience)
11. SENTINEL Contractor (Supply Chain)
12. SENTINEL Security (Integration)
13. SENTINEL Emergency (Response)

---

