# SENTINEL Implementation & Asset Onboarding
## How to Add a New Client Building and Assets

---

## OVERVIEW

When a new client signs up, you need to:
1. Create their organization/account
2. Add their building(s)/site(s)
3. Import or add their assets
4. Configure monitoring rules
5. Connect data sources
6. Validate and go live

---

