## ASSET IMPORT TEMPLATE

### Excel Template Columns

| Column | Required | Description | Example |
|--------|----------|-------------|---------|
| asset_tag | Yes | Unique identifier | AHU-L12-001 |
| description | Yes | Asset description | Level 12 North Air Handler |
| category | Yes | Main category | HVAC |
| asset_type | Yes | Equipment type | Air Handling Unit |
| sub_type | No | More specific type | Supply Air Unit |
| manufacturer | No | Make | Carrier |
| model | No | Model number | 39M |
| serial_number | No | Serial | 2419F04587 |
| capacity | No | Rated capacity | 25 |
| capacity_unit | No | Unit | kW |
| install_date | No | Installation date | 2008-03-15 |
| expected_life_years | No | Design life | 20 |
| warranty_expiry | No | Warranty end | 2013-03-15 |
| location_floor | No | Floor/level | Level 12 |
| location_zone | No | Zone/wing | North Wing |
| location_room | No | Room | Plant Room 12A |
| criticality | No | Importance | High |
| condition | No | Current state | Good |
| last_service_date | No | Last PPM | 2024-10-15 |
| ppm_frequency | No | Service interval | Quarterly |
| serves_description | No | What it serves | Executive floors |
| has_redundancy | No | Backup exists | No |
| notes | No | Additional info | Recently replaced motor |

---

## API FOR PROGRAMMATIC ASSET MANAGEMENT

### Create Asset via API

```bash
POST /api/v1/buildings/{building_id}/assets

{
  "asset_tag": "AHU-L12-001",
  "description": "Level 12 North Wing Air Handler",
  "category": "HVAC",
  "asset_type": "Air Handling Unit",
  "manufacturer": "Carrier",
  "model": "39M",
  "serial_number": "2419F04587",
  "capacity": 25,
  "capacity_unit": "kW",
  "install_date": "2008-03-15",
  "expected_life_years": 20,
  "location": {
    "floor": "Level 12",
    "zone": "North Wing",
    "room": "Plant Room 12A"
  },
  "criticality": "high",
  "condition": "good",
  "ppm_schedule": {
    "frequency": "quarterly",
    "last_service": "2024-10-15"
  },
  "metadata": {
    "serves": "Executive floors, boardrooms",
    "has_redundancy": false
  }
}
```

### Bulk Create Assets via API

```bash
POST /api/v1/buildings/{building_id}/assets/bulk

{
  "assets": [
    { "asset_tag": "AHU-L12-001", ... },
    { "asset_tag": "AHU-L12-002", ... },
    { "asset_tag": "CH-001", ... }
  ],
  "options": {
    "skip_duplicates": true,
    "validate_only": false
  }
}
```

