## SUMMARY: IMPLEMENTATION WORKFLOW

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     SENTINEL IMPLEMENTATION WORKFLOW                         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                              │
│  DAY 1: Setup                                                                │
│  ├─ Create organization                                                      │
│  ├─ Add building(s)                                                          │
│  └─ Configure users                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│  WEEK 1: Assets                                                              │
│  ├─ Import asset register (Excel or CAFM)                                   │
│  ├─ Review and clean data                                                    │
│  ├─ Define asset relationships                                               │
│  └─ Upload documentation (manuals, photos)                                   │
│                                                                              │
│  WEEK 2: Integrations                                                        │
│  ├─ Connect BMS (if available)                                              │
│  ├─ Connect alarm system                                                     │
│  ├─ Import historical work orders                                            │
│  └─ Map data points to assets                                                │
│                                                                              │
│  WEEK 3: Configuration                                                       │
│  ├─ Set prediction thresholds                                                │
│  ├─ Configure alert recipients                                               │
│  ├─ Test alert delivery                                                      │
│  └─ Train users                                                              │
│                                                                              │
│  WEEK 4: Go-Live                                                             │
│  ├─ Final validation                                                         │
│  ├─ Activate building                                                        │
│  ├─ Monitor initial predictions                                              │
│  └─ Refine as needed                                                         │
│                                                                              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

*Time to value: 2-4 weeks for basic setup, 6-8 weeks for full integration with historical data and BMS.*

