## MCP SERVER CONFIGURATION

### Server Manifest

```json
{
  "name": "simbiot-mcp",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "SIMBIOT Building Intelligence MCP Server",
  "author": "Bidvest FM / SENTINEL",

  "capabilities": {
    "tools": true,
    "resources": true,
    "prompts": true,
    "logging": true
  },

  "authentication": {
    "type": "api_key",
    "header": "X-SIMBIOT-API-KEY"
  },

  "transport": {
    "type": "sse",
    "endpoint": "https://api.sentinel.ai/mcp/simbiot"
  }
}
```

---

## TOOLS

### Building & Asset Tools

#### get_buildings

List all buildings the user has access to.

```json
{
  "name": "get_buildings",
  "description": "List all buildings in the portfolio with summary status",
  "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "status_filter": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["all", "critical", "warning", "healthy"],
        "description": "Filter by health status"
      },
      "region": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Filter by region (e.g., 'Gauteng', 'Western Cape')"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "buildings": [
    {
      "id": "bld-theplace-001",
      "name": "The Place",
      "address": "1 Sandton Drive, Sandton",
      "gla_sqm": 45000,
      "asset_count": 312,
      "health_score": 78,
      "critical_alarms": 2,
      "high_risk_assets": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "bld-sandton-002",
      "name": "Sandton City",
      "address": "Sandton City Complex",
      "gla_sqm": 128000,
      "asset_count": 534,
      "health_score": 85,
      "critical_alarms": 0,
      "high_risk_assets": 1
    }
  ],
  "total": 2
}
```

---

#### get_assets

List assets for a building with optional filtering.

```json
{
  "name": "get_assets",
  "description": "List assets for a building, optionally filtered by type, health, or risk",
  "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "building_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Building ID (required)"
      },
      "asset_type": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["AHU", "Chiller", "Pump", "Generator", "UPS", "VSD", "FCU", "all"],
        "description": "Filter by asset type"
      },
      "health_below": {
        "type": "number",
        "description": "Return assets with health score below this value"
      },
      "risk_above": {
        "type": "number",
        "description": "Return assets with risk score above this value"
      },
      "criticality": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["critical", "high", "medium", "low"],
        "description": "Filter by asset criticality"
      }
    },
    "required": ["building_id"]
  }
}
```

**Example Response:**
