## SKILL ARCHITECTURE

### Skill Definition Schema

```yaml
skill:
  id: hvac-diagnostics
  name: HVAC Diagnostics Expert
  version: 1.0.0
  description: Diagnoses HVAC equipment faults and recommends corrective actions

  # What this skill knows about
  domain:
    equipment_types:
      - AHU
      - Chiller
      - Cooling Tower
      - FCU
      - VAV
      - Heat Pump
    knowledge_areas:
      - Refrigeration cycles
      - Air distribution
      - Psychrometrics
      - Motor diagnostics
      - Control systems

  # MCP tools this skill can use
  mcp_tools:
    - get_asset_detail
    - get_alarms
    - get_trends
    - get_health_score
    - get_risk_score
    - get_work_orders
    - search_alarms
    - create_work_order

  # When to activate this skill
  triggers:
    - keywords: [AHU, chiller, cooling, heating, aircon, HVAC, temperature, humidity]
    - alarm_codes: [TEMP_HIGH, TEMP_LOW, TRIP, FREEZE, PRESS_HIGH, PRESS_LOW]
    - asset_types: [AHU, Chiller, FCU, VAV, CoolingTower]

  # Workflows this skill can execute
  workflows:
    - fault_diagnosis
    - root_cause_analysis
    - performance_optimization
    - ppm_recommendation
```

