│  • Chiller plant auxiliaries (pumps, towers, VFDs)                         │
│                                                                              │
│  KNOWLEDGE BASE:                                                             │
│  • Refrigerant properties (R410A, R134a, R32, R1234ze)                     │
│  • Compressor types and failure modes                                       │
│  • Oil management systems                                                   │
│  • Condenser/evaporator performance                                         │
│  • Chiller sequencing and staging                                           │
│  • Efficiency optimization (kW/ton)                                         │
│                                                                              │
│  FAULT CODES (by manufacturer):                                              │
│  • Carrier: 30XA, 30RB, 19XR series                                        │
│  • Trane: RTAC, CVHF, CenTraVac                                            │
│  • York: YK, YD, YVAA series                                               │
│  • Daikin: Applied systems                                                  │
│                                                                              │
│  DIAGNOSTIC WORKFLOWS:                                                       │
│  • Compressor trip analysis                                                 │
│  • High head pressure diagnosis                                             │
│  • Low suction pressure diagnosis                                           │
│  • Oil pressure faults                                                      │
│  • Refrigerant leak detection                                               │
│  • COP degradation analysis                                                 │
│  • Condenser approach analysis                                              │
│                                                                              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Diagnostic Decision Tree (built into skill):**

```
CHILLER TRIP DIAGNOSIS
│
├─ Get fault code from BMS
│   │
│   ├─ High Discharge Pressure
│   │   ├─ Check condenser water temp → High? → Cooling tower issue
│   │   ├─ Check condenser approach → High? → Tube fouling
│   │   ├─ Check refrigerant charge → Overcharged?
│   │   └─ Check non-condensables → Air in system?
│   │
│   ├─ Low Suction Pressure
│   │   ├─ Check evaporator water flow → Low? → Pump/valve issue
│   │   ├─ Check refrigerant charge → Undercharged? → Leak
│   │   ├─ Check expansion valve → Stuck?
│   │   └─ Check evaporator approach → High? → Tube fouling
│   │
│   ├─ Oil Pressure Fault
│   │   ├─ Check oil level → Low? → Oil migration/leak
│   │   ├─ Check oil temp → High? → Oil cooler issue
│   │   ├─ Check oil filter DP → High? → Replace filter
│   │   └─ Check oil pump → Worn?
│   │
│   ├─ Motor Overload
│   │   ├─ Check current vs RLA → How much over?
│   │   ├─ Check voltage → Low voltage?
│   │   ├─ Check motor winding temp → Overheating?
│   │   └─ Check mechanical load → Bearing issue?
│   │
│   └─ Communication Fault
│       ├─ Check network connection
│       ├─ Check controller power
│       └─ Check BACnet/Modbus settings
```

