### What This Enables

| Layer | Purpose | Example |
|-------|---------|---------|
| **Skills** | Domain expertise | "HVAC Expert knows chiller fault codes" |
| **MCP Server** | Data access | "Get me alarms for this asset" |
| **Connectors** | Data ingestion | "Parse this Honeywell CSV export" |
| **Host Systems** | Source of truth | "BMS logs, CAFM work orders" |

### The Power of Skills

- **Reusable** - Build once, use across all buildings
- **Shareable** - Marketplace for community skills
- **Extensible** - Anyone can create custom skills
- **Intelligent** - Combine AI + domain knowledge + real data

