# SENTINEL Equipment Lookup Tool
## Web-Based Fault Code Resolution & Parts Sourcing

---

## OVERVIEW

A simple, powerful tool that scrapes manufacturer websites, parts suppliers, and technical forums to provide instant fault diagnosis and parts ordering information.

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                              │
│   Input:  "Carrier 30XA chiller, fault code E4"                             │
│                                                                              │
│   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │
│   │                    EQUIPMENT LOOKUP TOOL                             │   │
│   │                                                                      │   │
│   │   1. Search manufacturer site for fault code                        │   │
│   │   2. Search parts suppliers for related parts                       │   │
│   │   3. Search forums for real-world fixes                             │   │
│   │                                                                      │   │
│   └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
│                                                                              │
│   Output:                                                                    │
│   • Fault: Low Oil Pressure                                                 │
│   • Fix: Check oil level, replace filter, check pump                       │
│   • Parts: Oil Filter P/N 30HX-405-332 - R2,450 @ Carrier SA               │
│                                                                              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

