### 3. Repair Procedures

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                              │
│   REPAIR GUIDE MODE                                                          │
│                                                                              │
│   Step-by-step procedures with safety warnings                              │
│                                                                              │
│   ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   Tech: "How do I replace the oil filter on this Carrier 30XA?"   │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   SENTINEL: "Here's the oil filter replacement procedure:          │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   ⚠️ SAFETY FIRST:                                                 │   │
│   │   • Isolate and lock out power                                     │   │
│   │   • Wait 10 minutes for oil pressure to equalize                   │   │
│   │   • Oil may be hot - wear gloves                                   │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   📋 PROCEDURE:                                                     │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   1. Close isolation valves either side of filter                  │   │
│   │      (V-12 and V-13 on the oil schematic)                          │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   2. Place drain pan under filter housing                          │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   3. Remove filter housing cover (4x 13mm bolts)                   │   │
│   │      ⚠️ Loosen slowly - residual pressure may be present          │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   4. Remove old filter element - note orientation                  │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   5. Inspect housing for debris or metal particles                 │   │
│   │      🔴 Metal particles = bearing wear, investigate further       │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   6. Install new filter (P/N 30HX-405-332)                         │   │
│   │      - Lubricate O-ring with clean oil                             │   │
│   │      - Ensure correct seating                                       │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   7. Replace cover, torque bolts to 25 Nm in star pattern         │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   8. Open isolation valves                                         │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   9. Start chiller on manual, check for leaks                      │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   10. Verify oil pressure returns to normal (>35 psi)              │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   Need me to send this to your phone as a checklist?"             │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
│                                                                              │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

