│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   SENTINEL: "That's a **Danfoss EVR 15 Solenoid Valve**            │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   • Type: Normally closed, direct operated                         │   │
│   │   • Connection: 5/8" ODF solder                                    │   │
│   │   • Coil: 220V AC (the coil is separate - check voltage)          │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   Common issues with this valve:                                    │   │
│   │   • Coil burnout (check resistance: should be ~2kΩ)               │   │
│   │   • Stuck closed (debris in seat)                                  │   │
│   │   • Leaking (worn seat or diaphragm)                               │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   Part numbers if you need to replace:                              │   │
│   │   • Complete valve: 032F3056                                        │   │
│   │   • Coil only: 018F6701 (220V)                                     │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │   Want me to help you test it?"                                    │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
│                                                                              │
