## MCP TOOL DEFINITION

### lookup_fault_code

```json
{
  "name": "lookup_fault_code",
  "description": "Look up a fault code for specific equipment and get diagnosis, fix, and parts",
  "inputSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "manufacturer": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Equipment manufacturer (e.g., 'Carrier', 'Trane', 'Daikin')"
      },
      "model": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Model number (e.g., '30XA', 'RTAC', 'VRV IV')"
      },
      "fault_code": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Fault/error code displayed (e.g., 'E4', 'AL01', 'F-41')"
      },
      "equipment_type": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["chiller", "ahu", "vsd", "controller", "pump", "compressor", "other"],
        "description": "Type of equipment"
      }
    },
    "required": ["manufacturer", "fault_code"]
  }
}
```

