**TECHNICAL NOTE: Connecting to Siemens PXC Controllers**

You mean connect directly to a **Siemens PXC controller** (the actual automation station in the panel)?

## Connection Options

### Option 1: Ethernet Port (Best)
- Plug Jetson directly into PXC ETH P2 port (if free)
- Same subnet as PXC, use BACnet/IP to read all points
- Get real-time values, alarms, trends from controller
- ⚠️ Don't unplug existing cables!

### Option 2: Panel Network Switch
- Look for spare switch port inside BMS panel
- Tap into existing BMS network
- Can see PXC controller AND Desigo server
- ✅ Safest approach if spare port available

### Option 3: CSV Export from Desigo CC (Fallback)
- No physical connection to controller
- Export alarms/trends from Desigo CC workstation
- Process CSV files with SIMBIOT parser
- ✅ Zero risk to production system

