## **SENTINEL + Moltbot Integration**

Looking at Molt.bot - this is a **multi-tenant AI agent platform**. Smart integration!

This is brilliant! Moltbot (formerly Clawdbot) is a **personal AI agent platform** that:

- Runs on your machine (local or cloud)
- Connects via WhatsApp, Telegram, Discord, Slack
- Has persistent memory
- Can execute shell commands, browse web, control systems
- Extensible with custom skills

