Tech sends voice note: "Just finished the AHU filter change on
level 10, filters were really blocked, recommend monthly checks
instead of quarterly"

→ Transcribes voice to text
→ Extracts: Asset (AHU-L10), Work done (filter change),
   Finding (blocked), Recommendation (monthly schedule)
→ Updates job card with notes
→ Flags recommendation for FM manager review
```

