```csv
desk_id,floor,zone_id,fcu_id,near_window
21,L12,Zone-12-North,FCU-L12-03,false
22,L12,Zone-12-North,FCU-L12-03,false
23,L12,Zone-12-North,FCU-L12-03,true
24,L12,Zone-12-North,FCU-L12-03,true
25,L12,Zone-12-North,FCU-L12-03,true    ← Desk 25 near window
...
```

**Option 4: AI-Assisted from Plans**
