│   │        • PIR-L12-25: Occupied (your desk)                          │   │
│   │        • PIR-L12-26: Unoccupied                                    │   │
│   │        • PIR-L12-27: Unoccupied                                    │   │
│   │        • Daylight: 850 lux (bright sun)                            │   │
│   │        • Lights: 30% (daylight dimming active)                     │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
│   │        Root cause: Solar gain from window, low occupancy           │   │
│   │        means less internal heat load but you're getting            │   │
│   │        direct sun.                                                  │   │
│   │                                                                     │   │
