The **killer feature**: Those 1,315 PIR sensors now feed real-time occupancy AND daylight data into every comfort diagnosis. When someone says "too hot at desk 25", SENTINEL knows:

1. The exact zone temperature (from Desigo)
2. Whether the FCU is working (from Desigo)
3. How many people are nearby (from Scenecom PIR)
4. How much sunlight is hitting that area (from Scenecom lux sensor)
5. Whether the desk is near a window (from RAG/desk mapping)

**This is genuinely intelligent building management.**

